<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#101b2b"><meta name="description" content="Flight deal inspiration for Filipino travellers in the UAE and Philippines. Compare fares from Abu Dhabi, Dubai and Philippine gateways.">
  <title>GetOffDeals — Flight deals worth the trip</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ url_for('static', filename='style.css') }}">
</head>
<body>
<header class="nav-wrap"><nav class="nav container"><a class="brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-mark">↗</span> takeoff<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><div class="nav-links"><a href="#deals">Explore deals</a><a href="#how">How it works</a></div><a class="nav-cta" href="#search">Find a flight <span>↗</span></a><button class="menu-toggle" aria-label="Toggle navigation" aria-expanded="false">☰</button></nav></header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-glow"></div><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> GOOD TRIPS. BETTER PRICES.</div><h1>Your next<br>great escape<br><em>costs less.</em></h1><p class="hero-sub">Flight inspiration for Filipinos flying between the UAE and the Philippines—plus city breaks and island escapes worth saving for.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-lime" href="#deals">Explore flight deals <span>↘</span></a><div class="social-proof"><div class="avatar-stack"><i>✈</i><i>☀</i><i>⌁</i></div><span>More adventure.<br><b>Less fare.</b></span></div></div><div class="hero-note"><span>✳</span> Prices change quickly. When you spot a deal, move fast.</div></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><div class="sun-disc"></div><div class="hero-destination"><span class="destination-kicker">YOUR NEXT PIN ON THE MAP</span><strong>Somewhere<br>beautiful.</strong><span class="route-line">AUH <b>──── ✈ ────</b> ?</span></div><div class="ticket-card"><div class="ticket-top"><span>TAKEOFF / TRAVEL NOTE</span><span>✳ 01</span></div><div class="ticket-main"><div><small>DEPARTING FROM</small><b>{{ origin }}</b><span>Abu Dhabi</span></div><div class="ticket-plane">✈</div><div><small>DESTINATION</small><b>ANYWHERE</b><span>Choose your mood</span></div></div><div class="ticket-bottom"><span>FIND YOUR FARE</span><span>↗</span></div></div><span class="floating-stamp">GO<br>FAR.</span></div></div><div class="container hero-foot"><span>MADE FOR CURIOUS TRAVELLERS</span><span class="foot-rule"></span><span>FOR FILIPINOS IN THE UAE & PHILIPPINES</span></div></section>
<section class="search-section" id="search"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading search-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow dark-eyebrow">LET'S GET YOU OUT THERE</span><h2>Where to next?</h2></div><span class="search-side-note">Your next story starts<br>with one search.</span></div><form id="flight-search" class="search-panel"><label class="field"><span>FROM</span><div class="field-value"><span class="field-icon">⌖</span><input id="origin" maxlength="3" value="{{ origin }}" aria-label="Origin airport code" required><small>AUH, DXB, MNL, CEB</small></div></label><button type="button" class="swap-btn" id="swap" aria-label="Swap airports">⇄</button><label class="field"><span>TO</span><div class="field-value"><span class="field-icon">◎</span><input id="destination" maxlength="3" placeholder="TBS" aria-label="Destination airport code" required><small>MNL, CEB, CRK, KLO</small></div></label><label class="field date-field"><span>DEPARTURE</span><div class="field-value"><span class="field-icon">▦</span><input id="departure" type="date" required><small>Choose your date</small></div></label><label class="field date-field"><span>RETURN <i>(OPTIONAL)</i></span><div class="field-value"><span class="field-icon">▦</span><input id="return-date" type="date"><small>One-way or return</small></div></label><label class="field passenger-field"><span>TRAVELLERS</span><div class="field-value"><span class="field-icon">♙</span><select id="adults" aria-label="Number of adults"><option value="1">1 adult</option><option value="2">2 adults</option><option value="3">3 adults</option><option value="4">4 adults</option><option value="5">5 adults</option><option value="6">6 adults</option></select></div></label><button class="button button-dark search-submit" type="submit"><span>Search fares</span><b>↗</b></button></form><p class="search-disclaimer">Live search requires your own Amadeus API credentials. Airport codes are used for this first version.</p><div id="search-status" class="search-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="search-results" class="search-results"></div></div></section>
<section class="deals-section" id="deals"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow dark-eyebrow">A LITTLE TRAVEL INSPIRATION</span><h2>Good deals. <em>Great stories.</em></h2><p class="section-sub">From trips home to Philippine island escapes and international getaways. Sample prices are illustrative—not live offers.</p></div><div class="deal-controls"><button class="filter active" data-filter="all">All picks</button><button class="filter" data-filter="city">City breaks</button><button class="filter" data-filter="nature">Nature & coast</button><button class="filter" data-filter="homecoming">Philippines</button></div></div><div id="deal-grid" class="deal-grid"><div class="loading-card">Finding your next adventure…</div></div><div class="disclaimer"><span>ⓘ</span><p><b>A quick note on fares</b><br>Sample deal prices are for design/demo purposes only. Actual prices, baggage, taxes, availability and booking terms are set by the airline or booking provider and can change at any time.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="manifesto" id="how"><div class="container manifesto-grid"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE TAKEOFF WAY</span><h2>Spend less on<br>the ticket. <em>Live more<br>on the trip.</em></h2></div><div class="manifesto-right"><p>We believe travel should feel exciting before you even leave home. Takeoff brings fare inspiration and flight search together, so you can spend less time hunting and more time imagining.</p><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span>01</span><div><b>Find your spark</b><p>Browse destinations and discover a place worth going.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>02</span><div><b>Compare the fare</b><p>Search available itineraries and check the details before booking.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>03</span><div><b>Make it happen</b><p>Check final prices, baggage rules and terms with the airline or booking partner.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="newsletter"><div class="container newsletter-inner"><div><span class="eyebrow">THE OCCASIONAL GOOD FIND</span><h2>Let the deals<br>come to you.</h2><p>Get occasional flight-deal inspiration for UAE–Philippines routes and international trips. You can unsubscribe at any time.</p></div><form id="newsletter-form" class="newsletter-form"><label for="email">YOUR EMAIL ADDRESS</label><div><input id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" autocomplete="email" required><button class="button button-lime" type="submit">Notify me ↗</button></div><label class="consent-row"><input id="newsletter-consent" type="checkbox" required><span>I agree to receive Takeoff flight-deal emails. I can unsubscribe at any time.</span></label><small id="newsletter-status">Signup is saved locally; email delivery will be connected in a later step.</small></form></div></section>
</main><footer class="footer"><div class="container footer-inner"><a class="brand footer-brand" href="#top"><span class="brand-mark">↗</span> takeoff<span class="brand-dot">.</span></a><span>UAE ↔ Philippines · Travel further. Stay curious.</span><span>© <span id="year"></span> TAKEOFF · BUILT FOR THE NEXT GETAWAY</span></div></footer>
<script src="{{ url_for('static', filename='app.js') }}"></script>
</body></html>
